{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block States</strong> is a first-person <strong>movement-driven speedrun game</strong> inspired by classic FPS jump mechanics and old-school flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a delivery runner racing through a fractured, post-apocalyptic city divided into self-contained blocks. The world is falling apart \u2014 but the timer never stops. Every level is a race against yourself, your best runs, and players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no enemies</strong> and <strong>no distractions</strong>.<br>The challenge is movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain jumps, control momentum, and optimize routes to push faster and faster times. Restart instantly, keep your flow, and chase the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All times are tracked through <strong>Steam leaderboards</strong>, letting you compare your performance globally and compete for the top spot on every stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each block is a handcrafted speedrun course.<br>Learn the layout, discover shortcuts, and refine your movement to shave milliseconds off your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast restarts and clear feedback make improvement constant and addictive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>clean, low-poly visuals</strong> designed to stay out of your way.<br>Nothing interrupts the flow \u2014 the focus stays on speed, rhythm, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure first-person speedrunning gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based jumping and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant restarts to maintain flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted delivery blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam-integrated global leaderboards for all stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly, minimal visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speedrunners and movement-focused players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> \u2013 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong> \u2013 Look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> \u2013 Sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> \u2013 Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> \u2013 Restart (teleport to start, keep momentum)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab</strong> \u2013 View best times and Steam leaderboards</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Block 45: Concrete Velocity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/067a777e329138119174840ca85df9d01835ab4e.jpg"},{"name":"Block 14: Ruins of Momentum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/0bfbb34dcb0718b83f171831c40fb59ab20a1dfc.jpg"},{"name":"Block 3: Sector Slipstream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/1e0d85cda229dc4562f3cfb9a3d282b57fa70bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Block 7: Old City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/0d631e324b25cf2119cf72f99c888425b63f55e9.jpg"},{"name":"First Drop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/2001b8ce84e2197425ecec27aa3502602b3f9154.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/b7261c535707b39380a8ebad93b1dcc398a9eec9.jpg"},{"name":"On the Clock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/f6ddb99df65efa8967e9ffb473fd5bc86b96d695.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/f74bef03eb2712cf1e6a77de2e57643510137b1d.jpg"},{"name":"Block States Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/c24e4fce94fe7f69745056df70b1c6e3a3af059d.jpg"},{"name":"Burned Mix Disc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4058260/45582028c2f43c32a4f03257dbf84687d48ab9a7.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058260?t=1769002209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058260/a66d4652b27184de9f8b0ecdaa50a220b1be7b18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769002209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058260/c268b2b10c3b2eed3bc0c72db3b801d96a2d4ba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769002209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058260/c268b2b10c3b2eed3bc0c72db3b801d96a2d4ba8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769002209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block States</strong> is a first-person <strong>movement-driven speedrun game</strong> inspired by classic FPS jump mechanics and old-school flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a delivery runner racing through a fractured, post-apocalyptic city divided into self-contained blocks. The world is falling apart \u2014 but the timer never stops. Every level is a race against yourself, your best runs, and players around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no enemies</strong> and <strong>no distractions</strong>.<br>The challenge is movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain jumps, control momentum, and optimize routes to push faster and faster times. Restart instantly, keep your flow, and chase the perfect run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All times are tracked through <strong>Steam leaderboards</strong>, letting you compare your performance globally and compete for the top spot on every stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each block is a handcrafted speedrun course.<br>Learn the layout, discover shortcuts, and refine your movement to shave milliseconds off your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast restarts and clear feedback make improvement constant and addictive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visuals &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>clean, low-poly visuals</strong> designed to stay out of your way.<br>Nothing interrupts the flow \u2014 the focus stays on speed, rhythm, and precision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure first-person speedrunning gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based jumping and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant restarts to maintain flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted delivery blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam-integrated global leaderboards for all stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly, minimal visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speedrunners and movement-focused players</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> \u2013 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong> \u2013 Look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> \u2013 Sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> \u2013 Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> \u2013 Restart (teleport to start, keep momentum)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab</strong> \u2013 View best times and Steam leaderboards</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lomz","https://www.